{"id":"4016120363600069677","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"看到推上有克拉說 尹淨漢每次要親秀都完全沒有證據\n直播 預錄 簽售上都說過「要我們親親嗎？」\n他腦袋裡都是親親親 這已經不是飯撒服務了 而是自助服務了\n\nㄴ還有人一直說這些都是為了「賣」或是滿足粉絲 但其實根本沒人要求他這麼做\nㄴ尹淨漢唯一聽到叫他去親秀的聲音其實都是他腦袋裡的聲音\n\n我快笑瘋「It’s always kiss kiss kiss with him.」\n既然如此那就祝尹淨漢在演唱會上拿到大結果吧！😍","username":"m1mii.shu","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@m1mii.shu/post/De8IDE_mEQt","timestamp":"2026-10-26T01:41:17Z","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-10-26T02:46:35.426304836Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-26T02:47:00.612528Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-26T02:47:00.612528Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_6b5e694032d2e2e8","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
